ph\" >The Black Sheep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The White Knights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blue Collars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Green Thumbs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gold Diggers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Silver Spoons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bronze Age</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Marooned Sailors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Purple Haze</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Red Flags</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys / WASD ..........................................Roll around</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SpaceBar...............................................................Pause game</p>",
